1
00:00:09,134 --> 00:00:11,054
Okay, if no one else will say it, I will.

2
00:00:11,720 --> 00:00:13,720
(Raj:)We really suck at paintball.

3
00:00:15,098 --> 00:00:16,808
HOWARD:
That was absolutely humiliating.

4
00:00:16,975 --> 00:00:19,975
LEONARD: Oh, come on. Some battles
you win, some battles you lose.

5
00:00:20,145 --> 00:00:25,525
HOWARD: Yes, but you don't have to lose
to Kyle Bernstein's bar mitzvah party.

6
00:00:26,234 --> 00:00:31,404
(Leonard:)I think we have to acknowledge, those were
some fairly savage preadolescent Jews.

7
00:00:33,533 --> 00:00:35,873
No, we were annihilated
by our own incompetence...

8
00:00:36,036 --> 00:00:39,126
(Sheldon:)...and the inability of some people
to follow the chain of command.

9
00:00:39,289 --> 00:00:40,619
(Leonard:)Sheldon, let it go.

10
00:00:40,790 --> 00:00:45,040
No, I wanna talk about the fact
that Wolowitz shot me in the back.

11
00:00:45,628 --> 00:00:49,838
I shot you for a good reason.
You were leading us into disaster.

12
00:00:50,258 --> 00:00:52,428
(Sheldon:)I was giving clear, concise orders.

13
00:00:52,594 --> 00:00:54,014
You hid behind a tree yelling:

14
00:00:54,179 --> 00:00:57,019
"Get the kid in the yarmulke!
Get the kid in the yarmulke!"

15
00:00:57,182 --> 00:00:58,642
- Oh, hey, guys.
- Oh, hey, Penny.

16
00:00:58,808 --> 00:01:01,018
(Leonard:)- Hello.
- Morning, ma'am.

